<title>HONG KONG: Perennial debuts at HK$1.10 per share.</title>
<headline>Perennial debuts at HK$1.10 per share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of cable and wire manufacturer Perennial International Ltd made their trading debut at HK$1.10 per share on Monday, compared with the issue price of HK$1.07.  </p>
<p>Perennial offered 60 million shares, consisting of 40 million new shares and 20 million existing shares. Its initial public offering was about 2.03 times subscribed.</p>
<p>The company said proceeds would be used to boost production capacity, buy machinery and repay debt as well as for working capital.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
